<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{TITLE}}</title>
<style>
/* ── DECK STRUCTURE — genuine 16:9 ─────────────────────────────────────────
   Page box is 338.67 x 190.5 mm = 960 x 540 pt, the standard presentation
   geometry (13.333in x 7.5in), matching the template's own name.
   An earlier revision declared the name 16:9 while sizing the page 297x210mm,
   which is A4 LANDSCAPE (4:3-ish) — the file would have been a different shape
   than its label promised. Either fix the geometry or fix the name; sizing to
   297x210mm is a one-line change if a print-on-A4 deck is ever wanted.

   @page margin MUST be 0. With a non-zero margin the printable box is smaller
   than the page box, each slide overflows, and the renderer emits TWO pages per
   slide — title on one, body on the next — silently. The slide supplies its own
   padding instead.
   Render through the chromium engine, which always passes
   --no-pdf-header-footer; otherwise the render date, the document title and the
   raw file:/// source path print on every page. */
@page { size: 338.67mm 190.5mm; margin: 0; }
html { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
body { margin: 0; }
.slide { width: 338.67mm; height: 190.5mm; padding: 15mm 18mm; box-sizing: border-box;
         page-break-after: always; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
.slide:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
.slide h1 { font-size: 27pt; margin: 0 0 5mm 0; }
.slide h2 { font-size: 15pt; margin: 0 0 7mm 0; }
.slide p, .slide li { font-size: 12.5pt; line-height: 1.5; }
.slide .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 8mm; left: 18mm; right: 18mm;
                 font-size: 8pt; color: var(--muted); display: flex;
                 justify-content: space-between; }
.slide .rule { height: 4px; width: 40mm; background: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 7mm 0; }

/* ── THEME ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
{{THEME_CSS}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="slide">
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <h1>{{TITLE}}</h1>
  <p>{{SUBTITLE}}</p>
  <div class="footer"><span>{{EDITION}} · {{EDITION_DATE}}</span>
  <span>content_sha256 {{CONTENT_HASH}}</span></div>
</section>

{{BODY}}

</body>
</html>
